#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/models/account_edi_proxy_user.py:0
msgid ""
"A Peppol response was sent to the Peppol Access Point declaring you %"
"(status)s this document."
msgstr ""
"Der blev sendt et Peppol-svar til Peppol-adgangspunkt, hvor du erklærede dig "
"%(status)s dette dokument."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"A Receipt has been received  for a message that was previously sent by the "
"MSH generating this error, but the content does not match the message "
"content (e.g. some part has not been acknowledged, or the digest associated "
"does not match the signature digest, for NRR)."
msgstr ""
"Der er modtaget en kvittering for en tidligere besked sendt af MSH, som har "
"forårsaget denne fejl, men indholdet stemmer ikke overens med beskeden "
"(f.eks. er en del ikke bekræftet, eller den tilhørende oversigt stemmer ikke "
"med signaturoversigten for NRR)."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"A Receipt has not been received  for a message that was previously sent by "
"the MSH generating this error."
msgstr ""
"Der er ikke modtaget nogen kvittering for en tidligere besked sendt af MSH, "
"som har forårsaget denne fejl."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/wizard/peppol_registration.py:0
msgid "A connection to '%s' already exists."
msgstr "Der findes allerede en forbindelse til '%s'."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"A fragment is received but a previously received fragment message had the "
"same values for GroupId and FragmentNum"
msgstr ""
"Der modtages et fragment, men en tidligere modtaget fragmentmeddelelse havde "
"de samme værdier for GroupId og FragmentNum"

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"A fragment is received but more than one fragment message in a group of "
"fragments specifies a value for a compression element."
msgstr ""
"Der modtages et fragment, men der er mere end én fragmentmeddelelse i en "
"gruppe af fragmenter, der angiver en værdi for et komprimeringselement."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"A fragment is received but more than one fragment message in a group of "
"fragments specifies a value for this element."
msgstr ""
"Der modtages et fragment, men der findes mere end én fragmentmeddelelse i en "
"fragmentgruppe, som angiver en værdi for dette element."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"A fragment is received that relates to a group that was previously rejected."
msgstr "Der modtages et fragment, som henviser til en tidligere afvist gruppe."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"A message unit in a bundle was not processed because a related message unit "
"in the bundle caused an error."
msgstr ""
"En meddelelse i en gruppering blev ikke behandlet, fordi en tilhørende "
"meddelelse i grupperingen forårsagede en fejl."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/models/res_company.py:0
msgid ""
"A participant with these details has already been registered on the network. "
"If you have previously registered to a Peppol service, please deregister."
msgstr ""
"En deltager med disse oplysninger er allerede registreret i netværket. Hvis "
"du allerede har en tidligere registreret Peppol-tjeneste, skal du logge ud "
"af den pågældende tjeneste."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/models/res_company.py:0
msgid "A purchase journal must be used to receive Peppol documents."
msgstr ""
"En indkøbsjournal skal anvendes for at kunne modtage Peppol-dokumenter."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"A responding MSH indicates that it applies the alternate MEP binding to the "
"response message."
msgstr ""
"Et svarende MSH angiver, at den alternative MEP-binding anvendes på "
"svarmeddelelsen."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"A value is set for FragmentCount, but a previously received fragment had a "
"greature value."
msgstr ""
"Der blev angivet en værdi for FragmentCount, men et tidligere modtaget "
"fragment havde en større værdi."

