#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"Although the message document is well formed and schema valid, some element/"
"attribute contains a value that could not be recognized and therefore could "
"not be used by the MSH."
msgstr ""
"Selv om meddelelsesdokumentet er korrekt formateret og har et gyldigt skema, "
"indeholder et element/attribut en værdi, der ikke kunne genkendes og derfor "
"ikke kunne bruges af MSH."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"Although the message document is well formed and schema valid, some element/"
"attribute value cannot be processed as expected because the related feature "
"is not supported by the MSH."
msgstr ""
"Selv om meddelelsesdokumentet er korrekt formateret og har et gyldigt skema, "
"kan nogle element- eller attributværdier ikke behandles som forventet, fordi "
"den tilhørende funktion ikke understøttes af MSH."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"Although the message document is well formed and schema valid, some element/"
"attribute value is inconsistent either with the content of other element/"
"attribute, or with the processing mode of the MSH, or with the normative "
"requirements of the ebMS specification."
msgstr ""
"Selv om meddelelsesdokumentet er korrekt formateret og har et gyldigt skema, "
"er nogle element- eller attributværdier enten ikke konsistente med indholdet "
"af andre elementer/attributter, med MSH’s behandlingsmodus eller med de "
"normative krav i ebMS-specifikationen."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"Although the message document is well formed and schema valid, the presence "
"or absence of some element/ attribute is not consistent with the capability "
"of the MSH, with respect to supported features."
msgstr ""
"Selv om meddelelsesdokumentet er korrekt formateret og har et gyldigt skema, "
"svarer tilstedeværelsen eller fraværet af nogle elementer/attributter ikke "
"til MSH’s understøttede funktioner."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"Although the message was sent under Guaranteed delivery requirement, the "
"Reliability module could not get assurance that the message was properly "
"delivered, in spite of resending efforts."
msgstr ""
"Selv om beskeden blev sendt med garanteret levering, kunne "
"pålidelighedsmodulet trods gentagne forsøg ikke sikre korrekt levering af "
"beskeden."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"An Intermediary MSH was unable to route an ebMS message and stopped "
"processing the message."
msgstr ""
"En mellemliggende MSH kunne ikke videresende en ebMS-meddelelse og afbrød "
"derfor behandlingen af meddelelsen."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"An MSH has determined that the message is expired and will not attempt to "
"forward or deliver it."
msgstr ""
"En MSH har konstateret, at meddelelsen er udløbet, og vil derfor ikke "
"forsøge at videresende eller levere den."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid ""
"An entry in the routing function is matched that assigns the message to an "
"MPC for pulling, but the intermediary MSH is unable to store the message "
"with this MPC"
msgstr ""
"Der findes en passende postering i routingfunktionen, som tildeler "
"meddelelsen til en MPC til hentning, men den mellemliggende MSH kan ikke "
"gemme meddelelsen med denne MPC"

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
msgid "An error occurred during the decompression."
msgstr "Der opstod en fejl under dekomprimeringen."

#. module: account_peppol
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/account_peppol/exceptions.py:0
